WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:01.634
DANIEL:<i> Could you imagine</i>

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:04.604
if you could ever
capture life in a film.

00:00:07.373 --> 00:00:09.008
(CAMERA SHUTTER CLICKS)

00:00:09.708 --> 00:00:11.411
DANIEL'S FATHER: I would
like to introduce Daniel.

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:12.511
Hello!

00:00:12.611 --> 00:00:14.948
ERIN:<i> As a little boy,
 Dan had these visions</i>

00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:17.317
<i> about this film
 he was going to make.</i>

00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:19.152
DANIEL:<i> All I do is I have
 a video camera in my hand,</i>

00:00:19.252 --> 00:00:22.088
<i> and I believe that life
is an interesting enough story.</i>

00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:23.789
DANIEL'S MOTHER:
Not with my open closet!

00:00:23.889 --> 00:00:25.758
Dan. Don't video tape me
right now.

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:26.792
(LAUGHING)

00:00:27.393 --> 00:00:29.629
ERIN:<i> Over the years,
 Dan traveled to 42 countries.</i>

00:00:30.129 --> 00:00:32.364
<i> He was genuinely curious
 about people.</i>

00:00:32.464 --> 00:00:34.233
DANIEL:<i> I feel like
 I'm manifesting</i>

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:36.602
<i> the plotline of my dreams.</i>

00:00:36.702 --> 00:00:38.871
<i> What's the biggest thing
 that we don't understand?</i>

00:00:38.971 --> 00:00:40.106 line:0%
STUDENT:

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:42.408
No, it's nature
and the universe.

00:00:42.976 --> 00:00:45.912
ERIN:<i> Daniel collected something
 from everywhere that he went,</i>

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:48.915
<i> to remain connected
 to that place.</i>

00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:50.650
DANIEL:
<i>This is my favorite one so far.</i>

00:00:51.351 --> 00:00:53.553 line:0%
FELIX:

00:00:56.889 --> 00:00:58.391
<i> You feel
 the shift of reality.</i>

00:00:58.491 --> 00:01:00.427
-DANIEL: Run, Felix, run!
-The whoosh!

00:01:03.028 --> 00:01:05.298 line:0%
DANIEL:

00:01:09.436 --> 00:01:11.637
DOCTOR: We've had a look
under the microscope,

00:01:12.004 --> 00:01:15.408
and this is acute leukemia.

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:18.845
♪ (EMOTIONAL MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:01:18.945 --> 00:01:21.214
(CRYING)

00:01:22.882 --> 00:01:23.916
ERIN:
<i> I remember Dan saying,</i>

00:01:24.383 --> 00:01:25.918
<i> "It's linked to my film."</i>

00:01:27.019 --> 00:01:29.121
DANIEL:<i> Put yourself in
 the position of the character.</i>

00:01:29.655 --> 00:01:32.058
<i> They tell you, "You have
 six months to live."</i>

00:01:32.692 --> 00:01:34.127
<i> I don't want to find out
 what happens next,</i>

00:01:34.227 --> 00:01:35.628
<i> I want to stay here.</i>

00:01:38.831 --> 00:01:42.435
<i> I'm trying to figure out
 how to write a twist ending.</i>

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:46.606
<i> Get as close as you can...</i>

00:01:47.373 --> 00:01:48.908
<i> Okay. Here we go.</i>

00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:52.311
When you are my age,
nothing will be the same.

00:01:52.578 --> 00:01:53.413
Make a wish!

00:01:53.513 --> 00:01:55.482
Nobody knows
what I'm wishing for.

00:01:57.083 --> 00:01:59.219
<i> You will find
 the reason for yourself.</i>

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:02.321
<i> It will shine in your life</i>

00:02:02.422 --> 00:02:04.791
<i> as brightly as the sun
 shines in the sky.</i>

00:02:06.059 --> 00:02:10.396
<i> And most importantly,
remember that life is beautiful.</i>

00:02:11.630 --> 00:02:15.401 line:0%
<i> Even when it is sad or scary,
 look for that beauty.</i>

00:02:17.603 --> 00:02:19.639
<i> That made the whole trip
 worth it.</i>

